2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:09,800
Traditional solutions require centralized trust and vulnerable intermediaries.

3
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:16,000
Welcome to Hierkey: the sovereign dead man's switch and confidential document custody protocol built on NEAR Protocol.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:23,500
On the Hierkey dashboard, track on-chain heartbeat timers, guardian approvals, and cryptographic custody in real time.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:32,500
Powered by NEAR Function-Call Access Keys, decentralized keeper bots monitor heartbeat expirations and execute authorized inheritance triggers without ever accessing user funds.

6
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:39,000
Creating an Access Vault takes seconds: name your vault, designate trusted guardians, and configure a Shamir multi-signature threshold.

7
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:46,000
One click invokes the NEAR smart contract, establishing your sovereign vault on-chain.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Watch as we record a live Proof of Life heartbeat transaction, instantly resetting the countdown timer on NEAR Testnet.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:58,000
In the Documents center, sensitive recovery phrases and legal documents are encrypted client-side using ECIES before being pinned to IPFS via Pinata.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Only cryptographic commitments live on NEAR, ensuring zero-knowledge privacy, verifiable ownership, and tamper-proof custody.

11
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Every file is secured under strict guardian access policies with automated cryptographic release conditions.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,550
Hierkey is live on NEAR Testnet at hierkey.web.app. Protect your digital legacy today.
